    {
      "id": "2123979081897087351",
      "url": "https://x.com/NASAAdmin/status/2123979081897087351",
      "text": "2 weeks ago, I showed President Yamakawa where we’ll launch Japan’s Pressurized Rover on its journey to the Moon. Here in Japan, I saw the rover prototype undergoing testing at ATLA and spent time with our friends at @JAXA_en’s Tsukuba Space Center, with the opportunity to speak https://t.co/XD9tlmraJp",
      "created_at": "2026-11-21T03:17:29.000Z",
      "name": "NASA Administrator Jared Isaacman",
      "username": "NASAAdmin",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2001755387486232576/mf5hRS_U_bigger.jpg",
